# The build context is the repository root (see each service's Dockerfile), and this tree carries
# local tool state no image needs. Without this file every `docker build .` ships ~2 GB before the
# first instruction runs, which makes the lab build time out; the module cache alone is ~1.6 GB.
#
# NOT excluded: `*/bin/`. The `lab` stage packages a binary compiled on the host by
# localdev/build.mjs, so `ingestion/ingest-api/bin/…` must stay in the context. The `build` and
# `production` stages compile from source and ignore it.
.git
.tools
.testtmp
.integration
.research
.selftest
.cockpit
obsidian_vault
**/.tools
**/.selftest
**/node_modules
**/evidence
*.log
